{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21965","headline":"送王处士 · 白居易","name":"送王处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王门岂无酒，侯门岂无肉。\n主人贵且骄，待客礼不足。\n望尘而拜者，朝夕走碌碌。\n王生独拂衣，遐举如云鹄。\n宁归白云外，饮水卧空谷。\n不能随衆人，敛手低眉目。\n扣门与我别，酤酒留君宿。\n好去采薇人，终南山正绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21965.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21965","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}